        "title": "inHarmony Sound Lounge",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>Immerse yourself in the healing power of sound with the inHarmony Sound Lounge. This innovative device uses sound frequencies for whole-body relaxation, soothing your mind and rejuvenating your body. Equipped with four tactile transducers, two amplifiers, Sennheiser HD noise reduction headphones, and concert-quality cables, it delivers an amazing sound healing experience directly to your ears and body.</p><p>The lounge's wave-like design, coupled with a soft foam top, contours perfectly to your body, ensuring a comfortable, neutral posture. This design helps in unloading your joints and muscles, making you feel weightless, secure, and at peace, enhancing the whole-body relaxation and sound healing experience</p>",
