          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“As a seasoned meditator for nearly four decades, I can say that it is rare that something comes along that truly changes the experience. The inHarmony product line is the most amazing technology I have experienced to date to help people drop into deep states of relaxation, awareness, focus, healing, and presence, and do so almost immediately.”</p>",
            "author": "Nate Z.",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "8ec9c348-b7b6-4b67-a1b6-e818230044ab": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“This is an amazing item that can enhance your experience during prayer or meditation. This unique modality has great ergonomics for posture and comfort for those seeking extended sessions. The sound and vibration add an amazing and innovative experience.”</p>",
            "author": "Benjamin M.",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“The sound lounge is truly a next level immersive cocoon experience.”</p>",
            "author": "James L.",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-1",
